# Windsurf Cascade Engineering SOP Rules

## Universal Guidelines
Follow the Automated Engineering SOPs defined in `docs/agents/engineering_sop.md` and repository standards in `AGENTS.md`.

## Automatic SOP Interception
- **Bug/Issue**: SOP-1 (Capture Issue -> Feedback loop -> Hypotheses -> TDD -> Deploy)
- **Feature/Idea**: SOP-2 (Grill -> Domain/ADR -> Spec -> Implement -> Deploy)
- **Architecture/Review**: SOP-3 (Scope -> Audit -> Spec -> Dual Review)

Always lead responses with the compact Phase Card:
`> 📌 **[SOP 名称]** [■■□□□] 阶段 X/Y: 阶段名称 | **关联工单**: #ID (若有)`
